abstract: "Work in Progress — Academic Research Resource. Structured references, concepts, people, evidence and provisional research classifications accompany authored history and theory of ecological information. JSON is the structured-record authority; analytical Markdown remains authoritative for authored prose. Workbook sources are retained as legacy material. Bibliographic gaps and interpretative qualifications remain unresolved; no research release, DOI, licence or DRM conformance is asserted."
